WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.905
Finally, Candy and Terry met again.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:14.344
However, Terry doesn't know
how to reveal Susanna's accident to Candy.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:18.974
Now and then,
he would appear distant.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.254
Heart-racing curtain rising.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.532
Mr. Albert then agreed to live with me.

00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:43.735
Although he doesn't remember you,

00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:45.778
he told me he would really like to meet you.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:49.243
Here we are!
This is the hotel you're staying at.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.917
Oh, my! What a luxury hotel!

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:05.490
Candy, I have to get prepared,
we are having a final rehearsal tonight.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.722
I wish you good luck, Terry!

00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:11.031
Let's have a talk after the play tomorrow.

00:01:11.338 --> 00:01:12.464
Good Bye!

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.834
Terry!

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.270
I will be cheering for you
in the audience tomorrow.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.710
Thank you.

00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:33.518
I came to Broadway,

00:01:33.668 --> 00:01:35.787
I walked on the streets with Terry.

00:01:35.937 --> 00:01:39.161
I was able to see him and we reminisced
about our time together.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.928
Terry, as long as we're alive
we'll be able to see each other again.

00:01:43.078 --> 00:01:45.630
This is like a dream coming true, but...

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:49.334
Terry appeared to be uneasy
from time to time.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:57.810
Is it because of the show tomorrow?

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:03.118
It must be. This is the first time he is
the main character on such an important play.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.955
Alright, the rehearsal is finished.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.427
Good job, everyone!

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.831
Good luck tomorrow!

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.997
Terrius, you were distracted today.
You were not as good as usual.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.436
Will you be alright tomorrow?

00:02:24.586 --> 00:02:27.906
Distracted? No, I wasn't.

00:02:28.056 --> 00:02:31.342
It was obvious you were
bothered by something.

00:02:31.492 --> 00:02:34.181
Is there anything bothering you?

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.819
No, that's not true!

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.249
I didn't mean to upset you!

00:02:38.399 --> 00:02:41.323
Terrius, sorry to tell you this,
but I have to agree.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:47.158
Terry, take things as they come.

00:02:47.308 --> 00:02:50.128
Just focus on playing your role well.

00:02:50.278 --> 00:02:52.763
Rest well tonight.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.134
Yes.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.510
Candy will eventually find out
what happened to Susanna.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.577
I won't be able to hide all of this
from her forever.

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:10.419
When it happens, Candy will...

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:14.419
No, I have to concentrate.

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:17.258
I have to focus on tomorrow night.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.638
Candy came all the way
from Chicago.

00:03:33.788 --> 00:03:35.874
I have to present
the best performance for her.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:41.047
Terry should be home by now.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.415
For the best performance tomorrow,
you need to rest well.

00:03:44.565 --> 00:03:47.952
I would like to be with you
and cook you a nice breakfast.

00:03:48.102 --> 00:03:51.258
With some coffee, ham, salad, and toast.

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:57.429
I would bid farewell to you and wish you
the best of luck for your performance.

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:02.296
But... when will this dream come true?

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:13.880
It was a long trip for her,
she must be sleeping now.

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:18.319
Ok, I will do my best tomorrow!

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:21.819
Good night, Candy.

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:25.823
He jests at scars

00:04:25.973 --> 00:04:28.421
that never felt a wound.

00:04:28.571 --> 00:04:32.971
But, soft!
What light through yonder window breaks?

00:04:33.272 --> 00:04:34.999
It is the east,

00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:37.167
and Juliet is the sun.

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.688
Arise, fair sun,
and kill the envious moon.

00:04:40.858 --> 00:04:42.873
Who is already sick
and pale with grief.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.631
You didn't come to visit today.

00:05:06.781 --> 00:05:11.040
Susanna was very upset,
she was expecting you...

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:38.563
You know, Susanna is smiling
a little bit more each day,

00:05:38.713 --> 00:05:43.400
and this is because you come
and visit her every day.

00:05:47.279 --> 00:05:50.248
Please don't abandon her.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:52.884
I let you alone with her.

00:05:59.358 --> 00:06:01.792
Susanna, I am sorry I am late.

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:06.227
Terry, I was afraid
you were not coming today.

00:06:19.478 --> 00:06:21.503
You met her, didn't you?

00:06:22.481 --> 00:06:26.577
Is she still so full of life?

00:06:28.887 --> 00:06:30.681
Candy is so lucky.

00:06:30.831 --> 00:06:35.519
She can move around freely,
and being loved by you.

00:06:39.231 --> 00:06:42.667
She will go
to the premiere tomorrow, right?

00:06:44.169 --> 00:06:46.537
Good luck, Terry!

00:07:05.157 --> 00:07:06.647
Stop the carriage!

00:07:11.797 --> 00:07:13.355
I'll be right back!

00:07:16.835 --> 00:07:19.231
I want to bring flowers to Terry.

00:07:28.013 --> 00:07:29.372
This is absolutely amazing!

00:07:29.522 --> 00:07:32.814
Terry is the big star on the picture.

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:50.460
Eleanor Baker...

00:07:50.635 --> 00:07:52.662
She probably dyed
her hair black on purpose...

00:07:52.812 --> 00:07:56.032
But I recognize Terry's mother.
Eleanor Baker.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.537
She is so low-keyed.

00:08:00.687 --> 00:08:05.072
She must care for Terry very much.

00:08:06.184 --> 00:08:07.811
Isn't this Candy?

00:08:11.356 --> 00:08:14.350
Candy, can you tell me
why are you here?

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.768
Don't try to sneak in.

00:08:16.918 --> 00:08:21.831
Thanks for caring,
but I have a ticket.

00:08:25.703 --> 00:08:28.458
May I ask who gave you the ticket?

00:08:28.648 --> 00:08:31.501
Terry... Terrius gave it to me.

00:08:31.651 --> 00:08:35.452
Her face didn't even blush
when she lied.

00:08:36.447 --> 00:08:38.813
Still that harsh.

00:08:39.217 --> 00:08:41.117
I am not lying!

00:08:43.821 --> 00:08:45.755
The invitation is here.

00:08:47.825 --> 00:08:50.180
It is really an invitation.

00:08:51.496 --> 00:08:53.704
You must have found it on the street.

00:08:54.165 --> 00:08:57.627
You are probably right.
See what I am doing with it?

00:08:57.777 --> 00:08:59.329
Neil!

00:09:01.205 --> 00:09:02.638
That's too much!

00:09:03.441 --> 00:09:05.466
Why did you do this, Neil?

00:09:08.946 --> 00:09:10.208
Let me go!

00:09:11.749 --> 00:09:13.717
Let me teach you a lesson.

00:09:15.086 --> 00:09:16.553
Stop!

00:09:17.088 --> 00:09:19.022
- Candy!
- What does she want?

00:09:19.757 --> 00:09:22.015
Three against one,
that's not quite fair!

00:09:22.165 --> 00:09:24.654
Mind your own business.
Want me to beat you?

00:09:24.804 --> 00:09:27.960
Don't bully the small and weak.
Let him go!

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:31.127
This woman asked for it.

00:09:31.277 --> 00:09:33.629
Are you ever going to pay for this.

00:09:33.779 --> 00:09:35.695
Let me beat you down with a fist.

00:09:35.906 --> 00:09:38.207
How could you hit a woman?

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:39.525
It's not your business.

00:09:45.082 --> 00:09:47.007
Bitch!

00:09:55.092 --> 00:09:57.086
Why, Neil?

00:09:57.236 --> 00:10:00.653
You have no right to call
Master's name.

00:10:01.165 --> 00:10:02.557
Right.

00:10:10.841 --> 00:10:11.899
Wait a second!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.544
Wait a second!

00:10:33.847 --> 00:10:35.815
Sorry, invalid ticket.

00:10:36.116 --> 00:10:38.410
But, please let me in!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.178
Don't waste your time,
your ticket is not good.

00:10:40.328 --> 00:10:43.849
Besides,
there is no seat number on it.

00:10:43.999 --> 00:10:44.983
So, get out.

00:10:45.133 --> 00:10:49.121
The seat number is on
the other half of the ticket.

00:10:49.271 --> 00:10:51.857
Then bring me the other half!

00:10:52.007 --> 00:10:53.763
It’s the carriage...

00:10:54.201 --> 00:10:56.499
How many times
do you want me to explain?

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:00.196
I'll say it again.
This ticket is no good!

00:11:01.675 --> 00:11:05.338
Then, I'll buy another ticket, can I?

00:11:05.979 --> 00:11:07.172
For what day?

00:11:07.322 --> 00:11:09.306
For today of course!

00:11:11.151 --> 00:11:14.747
Unfortunately,
today's tickets are sold out.

00:11:15.007 --> 00:11:17.483
How can I see Terry then?

00:11:17.633 --> 00:11:20.886
Terrius? The main actor?

00:11:21.036 --> 00:11:23.054
Right. I am his friend.

00:11:23.764 --> 00:11:26.525
No, you are not going to get in
by fooling me.

00:11:26.775 --> 00:11:30.429
It's true.
It's Terrius who gave me the ticket.

00:11:30.579 --> 00:11:32.681
You can ask him about it.

00:11:32.881 --> 00:11:36.968
The actors are not allowed
to see any visitors before the show.

00:11:37.188 --> 00:11:38.734
Do you understand?

00:11:40.547 --> 00:11:42.108
All right! I have an idea.

00:11:44.684 --> 00:11:46.447
Excuse me for bothering you.

00:12:02.936 --> 00:12:06.431
Who are you?
No visitors are allowed here.

00:12:06.581 --> 00:12:09.434
I want to give these flowers to Terry...
To Terrius.

00:12:09.584 --> 00:12:11.477
Alright, give them to me.

00:12:11.678 --> 00:12:14.714
Can I see Terrius?
I would like to see him!

00:12:16.516 --> 00:12:20.247
But will he want to see you?
Hold on, let me go ask.

00:12:20.854 --> 00:12:23.755
My name is Candy.

00:12:24.057 --> 00:12:25.297
Got it.

00:12:25.447 --> 00:12:27.325
Great! I can get in.

00:12:29.896 --> 00:12:30.955
Please.

00:12:31.105 --> 00:12:34.359
Terrius, some flowers from a fan.

00:12:34.509 --> 00:12:36.061
Thanks.

00:12:36.211 --> 00:12:38.263
She also wants to see you,
what should we do?

00:12:38.671 --> 00:12:40.899
It's not a good time now.
Send her away.

00:12:41.049 --> 00:12:42.339
Ok.

00:12:45.545 --> 00:12:47.972
No? How could it be possible?

00:12:48.122 --> 00:12:51.042
I am sorry. You have to wait
until the show is finished.

00:12:51.192 --> 00:12:54.377
Alright. Where are the seats
for the audience?

00:12:54.754 --> 00:12:56.881
Go straight ahead...

00:12:57.123 --> 00:12:59.884
Hold on.
You entered from the back door?

00:13:00.034 --> 00:13:01.219
Yes.

00:13:01.369 --> 00:13:03.685
Do you have a ticket?
Let me see.

00:13:04.431 --> 00:13:05.689
I...

00:13:06.566 --> 00:13:09.274
So you wanted to sneak in
with a bouquet of flowers?

00:13:09.836 --> 00:13:12.127
- No, that's not it!
- Get out now.

00:13:12.772 --> 00:13:14.599
Please let me explain.

00:13:14.749 --> 00:13:17.635
Let me see Terrius,
then things will be clear.

00:13:17.855 --> 00:13:20.001
It's not possible, please go out.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.140
Wait a second.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.208
Candy! Aren't you Candy?

00:13:26.553 --> 00:13:27.918
Karen!

00:13:28.555 --> 00:13:30.115
You know her?

00:13:30.265 --> 00:13:32.884
Let me handle this.

00:13:33.034 --> 00:13:34.824
Candy, follow me.

00:13:37.163 --> 00:13:39.563
So you came here...

00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:43.588
You couldn't find Terrius.
Why didn't you ask for me?

00:13:43.778 --> 00:13:46.564
We only met once,
we barely know each other,

00:13:46.714 --> 00:13:49.033
I was not sure
if you remembered me.

00:13:49.183 --> 00:13:50.996
Oh, I remember very clearly.

00:13:51.211 --> 00:13:52.804
Thank you for helping me out.

00:13:53.004 --> 00:13:55.973
Later, if anyone bothers you...

00:13:56.123 --> 00:13:58.711
Show this autographed picture,
we never know.

00:13:59.118 --> 00:14:01.746
To my dear friend, Candy.

00:14:01.946 --> 00:14:02.930
Thank you.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.997
Candy, enjoy our show!

00:14:06.175 --> 00:14:09.144
Terrius and I are the perfect couple!

00:14:10.946 --> 00:14:14.712
Sorry you couldn't see Terrius.

00:14:16.435 --> 00:14:19.678
I didn't know you were playing Juliet,
that's great!

00:14:19.828 --> 00:14:21.265
That's not very nice of you to say!

00:14:21.415 --> 00:14:23.721
Sorry, I didn't mean
it to sound like it did.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.638
You think only Susanna
can play this role?

00:14:27.213 --> 00:14:28.472
Of course not.

00:14:28.622 --> 00:14:29.974
Even a substitute can do
a very good job, you know.

00:14:30.124 --> 00:14:32.476
I can guarantee
I will do better than Susanna

00:14:32.626 --> 00:14:33.878
for the role Juliet.

00:14:34.028 --> 00:14:37.514
Karen Kreis
will not let you down.

00:14:41.493 --> 00:14:44.758
I wonder why she was so angry...

00:14:44.964 --> 00:14:48.661
Susanna and she are rivals.
Maybe that's why.

00:14:52.972 --> 00:14:55.839
Karen took over Susanna's role.

00:14:56.008 --> 00:14:59.464
In another word,
Susanna was supposed to play Juliet.

00:14:59.614 --> 00:15:03.070
But Karen is replacing Susanna.

00:15:03.749 --> 00:15:05.876
What's going on?

00:15:06.026 --> 00:15:08.078
What happened to Susanna?

00:15:08.228 --> 00:15:09.848
I don't understand.

00:15:29.808 --> 00:15:31.676
How on earth did you sneak in?

00:15:32.111 --> 00:15:34.071
I did not sneak in.

00:15:34.221 --> 00:15:35.909
I walked in from the front door.

00:15:36.382 --> 00:15:37.775
Liar.

00:15:37.925 --> 00:15:40.318
You made a scene at the entrance.
Everybody saw that.

00:15:40.786 --> 00:15:44.313
Who was making a scene?
It was you.

00:15:45.624 --> 00:15:47.751
How would Brother make a scene?

00:15:47.901 --> 00:15:49.753
Why is Candy saying that?

00:15:50.203 --> 00:15:53.996
Eliza, forget it, let's go.

00:15:57.636 --> 00:16:01.404
Candy, I'll go find a member of staff,
and you'll be kicked out for good.

00:16:02.708 --> 00:16:05.768
Go ahead. I have this.

00:16:06.311 --> 00:16:08.336
An autograph of Karen Kreis.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:09.940
Where did you steal this from?

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.373
Look at the dedication on it.

00:16:12.884 --> 00:16:15.546
To my dear friend, Candy.

00:16:17.356 --> 00:16:20.507
Karen and I are old friends.

00:16:22.761 --> 00:16:25.794
She gave me this backstage.
Good-bye.

00:16:29.234 --> 00:16:31.031
How arrogant!

00:16:32.537 --> 00:16:35.999
It's very rare
to get such a positive review.

00:16:36.149 --> 00:16:40.511
The new face Terrius will play Romeo.
I can't wait to see him play.

00:16:41.112 --> 00:16:42.539
Me too, my dear.

00:16:42.689 --> 00:16:45.981
Isn't it pitiful for Susanna.

00:16:48.553 --> 00:16:51.281
She got badly hurt
when she was trying to save Terrius.

00:16:51.431 --> 00:16:54.655
She worked so hard to get this role,
and now this...

00:17:21.353 --> 00:17:24.254
Terry, watch out!

00:17:31.095 --> 00:17:33.723
He jests at scars

00:17:33.873 --> 00:17:36.190
that never felt a wound.

00:17:37.268 --> 00:17:38.496
But soft!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.861
What light through yonder window breaks?

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.268
It is the East,

00:17:45.418 --> 00:17:47.641
and Juliet is the sun!

00:17:48.045 --> 00:17:50.940
Arise, fair sun,

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.779
and kill the envious moon

00:18:00.324 --> 00:18:02.224
I had no idea that,

00:18:02.893 --> 00:18:05.987
Susanna had an accident from
trying to save Terry.

00:18:06.397 --> 00:18:09.059
Terry kept it a secret from me.

00:18:11.101 --> 00:18:14.129
Apparently, Terrius visits her every day.

00:18:14.279 --> 00:18:16.899
She got hurt because of him.

00:18:17.049 --> 00:18:19.340
He must be blaming himself.

00:18:21.345 --> 00:18:25.543
Would this explain
the distant look on his face...

00:18:25.949 --> 00:18:30.386
Terry, how did it happen?

00:18:31.622 --> 00:18:34.113
Why did you keep this
a secret from me, Terry?

00:18:51.942 --> 00:18:53.708
The last scene...

00:18:54.008 --> 00:18:57.506
Terry did a good job.
A rising star.

00:18:57.656 --> 00:18:59.141
Karen also did a good job.

00:18:59.291 --> 00:19:01.177
If Susanna was here...

00:19:01.327 --> 00:19:04.246
she might have done better.

00:19:04.396 --> 00:19:08.224
Susanna was taking care of Terrius
when he had a fever.

00:19:09.126 --> 00:19:13.286
I heard that
Terrius would marry her.

00:19:15.666 --> 00:19:17.458
Susanna loves you,

00:19:17.608 --> 00:19:21.630
sees you as someone
who can depend on for life.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.900
Terrius, please stay by her forever.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.302
Stay with her all your life.

00:19:27.452 --> 00:19:31.143
Terry, don't worry about me,
and please focus on the show.

00:19:32.082 --> 00:19:35.449
I...

00:19:38.789 --> 00:19:41.019
Susanna wants to marry Terry?

00:19:41.925 --> 00:19:43.722
That's so cruel!

00:19:44.795 --> 00:19:46.688
No matter how much she loves Terry,

00:19:46.838 --> 00:19:50.062
she shouldn't do this to Terry!

00:19:51.668 --> 00:19:55.627
This is not love.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:00.535
I need to see Susanna and talk to her.

00:20:22.299 --> 00:20:23.857
Excuse me...

00:20:24.501 --> 00:20:25.627
It's you again?

00:20:25.777 --> 00:20:28.230
Which hospital
is Susanna staying at?

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.839
You would like to visit her?
I think it is...

00:20:31.542 --> 00:20:32.901
St. Jacob's Hospital.

00:20:33.051 --> 00:20:34.238
Thank you!

00:20:48.892 --> 00:20:51.224
The intermission is over.

00:20:51.395 --> 00:20:52.726
But...

00:20:52.896 --> 00:20:56.630
But, I am not in a state
to enjoy the play anymore.

00:21:13.383 --> 00:21:16.478
Anxious, Candy can't help herself

00:21:16.628 --> 00:21:19.989
walking towards the hospital
where Susanna is staying.
